          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us go back to Vidya’s notebook and observe her opening the cover of the book in different scenarios."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.546,
            0.439,
            0.635
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "She makes a full turn of the cover when she has to write while holding the book in her hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.637,
            0.442,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "She makes a half turn of the cover when she has to open it on her table. In this case,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
